    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head>Cn 1018 1.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="1.1" corresp="#wit-d">And híg gecwǽdan þæt hi furðor on æmtan smeagan woldan. þeode þearfe mid godes filste. swa hi betst mihton.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And hig gecwædan þæt hi furðor on æmtan smeagan woldan þeode þearfe, mid Godes filste, swa hi betst mihton.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And they declared that they would consider further at leisure, with the help of God, what was necessary for the nation, as best they could.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And they proclaimed that, with God’s help, when time permitted they would reflect upon the needs of the realm as best they could.</ab>
      </div>
